(THG2-05: the Printing worked example, LANGUAGE.md:1294-1328, verbatim. It is
 a composite of THG2-01 (definition order, recursion), THG2-03 (a quoted field
 name), THG2-04 (a function member takes no part), THG2-06 (a whole thing
 interpolates under Print) and the type-possessive maker call of THG2-34.
 Note the boolean field prints as 1, which is how Vox prints a boolean
 everywhere, not something this section claims otherwise.
